WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.999 line:0
Split 13 cards: front 3, middle 5, back 5.
Everyone arranges at once; there are no turns.

00:00:06.999 --> 00:00:13.999 line:0
Select cards, then tap a row:
a pair goes in front.

00:00:13.999 --> 00:00:21.999 line:0
Five cards in the middle make a straight.

00:00:21.999 --> 00:00:29.999 line:0
The last five make a flush in the back.
Back ≥ middle ≥ front, or the hand fouls.

00:00:29.999 --> 00:00:38.999 line:0
Confirmed hands are final;
others stay hidden until all four submit.

00:00:38.999 --> 00:00:48.999 line:0
Then all hands show. Each row is compared with
every opponent, normally for one point.

00:00:48.999 --> 00:00:56.998 line:0
Winning all three rows against one opponent
is a sweep and doubles that pairing.

00:00:56.998 --> 00:01:06.000 line:0
West wins with +55;
all four totals add up to zero.
